 the I-81/I-84/I-380 junction carry the market, with big-box warehouse absorption concentrated in Jessup and Archbald and housing demand in South Abington Township, where mine subsidence, floodplain, and reclaimed culm banks constrain sites.</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#888888;padding-top:6px;\">Source: U.S. Census Bureau · Data verified: November 8, 2026</div></div>"],"feats":[["Lackawanna County Boundary",0,[[41.25399,-75.44762],[41.25425,-75.44696],[41.25463,-75.44632],[41.25489,-75.44618],[41.25557,-75.44568],[41.25613,-75.44523],[41.25639,-75.44489],[41.25672,-75.44422],[41.25688,-75.44333],[41.25714,-75.44302],[41.25785,-75.44149],[41.2581,-75.44081],[41.25811,-75.44037],[41.25829,-75.44037],[41.2585,-75.44059],[41.2587,-75.4409],[41.25893,-75.44108],[41.2596,-75.44111],[41.25993,-75.44121],[41.26045,-75.44146],[41.26077,-75.44155],[41.2611,-75.4415],[41.26997,-75.44178],[41.30419,-75.44347],[41.34627,-75.44587],[41.36964,-75.44713],[41.37002,-75.44718],[41.37294,-75.44717],[41.38763,-75.44829],[41.38877,-75.44852],[41.40917,-75.44892],[41.42531,-75.44965],[41.47922,-75.45284],[41.54635,-75.45713],[41.57331,-75.45897],[41.59494,-75.45963],[41.61712,-75.46073],[41.64158,-75.46224],[41.6417,-75.4749],[41.64163,-75.52975],[41.64164,-75.53129],[41.64172,-75.53291],[41.64174,-75.59231],[41.64185,-75.59763],[41.64192,-75.61897],[41.64211,-75.6513],[41.64211,-75.67745],[41.64226,-75.71995],[41.64076,-75.72047],[41.64048,-75.72063],[41.64026,-75.72069],[41.63986,-75.72072],[41.63937,-75.72066],[41.63911,-75.72053],[41.63863,-75.72009],[41.63832,-75.71966],[41.63804,-75.71887],[41.6378,-75.71862],[41.63755,-75.71854],[41.63688,-75.71845],[41.63667,-75.71851],[41.63612,-75.71878],[41.63593,-75.71907],[41.63564,-75.71988],[41.63492,-75.72102],[41.63459,-75.7217],[41.63461,-75.72294],[41.63484,-75.72514],[41.63497,-75.72558],[41.63544,-75.72783],[41.63564,-75.72858],[41.57405,-75.7743],[41.56847,-75.7693],[41.55518,-75.77927],[41.54353,-75.78751],[41.52423,-75.